PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786960091
OL,3,CWessex Water announces hosepipe ban
OL,4,Cacross our region
OL,6,FWessex Water has announced a hosepipe
OL,7,Fban after months of unprecedented dry
OL,8,Fweather, and heatwaves a which they
OL,9,Fsay has led to a "sustained high
OL,10,Fdemand for water".
OL,12,FThe company supply 1.4 million
OL,13,Fcustomers in parts of our region,
OL,14,Fincluding Bath, Somerset, Dorset and
OL,15,FWiltshire.
OL,17,FThe company say they have taken the
OL,18,Fdecision after more than 40 days of
OL,19,Fdemand for water "remaining at record-
OL,20,Fbreaking levels" and the region
OL,21,Fformally declared as being in drought.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
