PN,40102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786960091
OL,3,CWessex Water announces hosepipe ban
OL,4,Cacross our region
OL,6,FFrom Tuesday 18 August household
OL,7,Fcustomers have been told they must not
OL,8,Fuse a hosepipe for activities such as
OL,9,Fwatering gardens, washing cars,
OL,10,Fpatios, paths and driveways, cleaning
OL,11,Fwindows or filling swimming and
OL,12,Fpaddling pools.
OL,14,FThe ban marks the first time in 50
OL,15,Fyears that Wessex Water has introduced
OL,16,Frestrictions on water use, the last
OL,17,Ftime being the drought of 1976.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786960091
OL,3,CWessex Water announces hosepipe ban
OL,4,Cacross our region
OL,6,FWessex Water Chief Executive Ruth
OL,7,FJefferson said the decision to put a
OL,8,Fban in place comes from a combination
OL,9,Fof increased demand for water during
OL,10,Fthe ongoing dry weather and longer-
OL,11,Fterm forecasts meaning water resources
OL,12,Fmust be protected for both customers
OL,13,Fand the environment.
OL,15,FThe organisation say their repair
OL,16,Fteams have been fixing more leaks than
OL,17,Fever this summer across its supply
OL,18,Farea.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786960091
OL,3,CWessex Water announces hosepipe ban
OL,4,Cacross our region
OL,6,FMrs Jefferson said: "After 50 years
OL,7,Fwithout a hosepipe ban in the Wessex
OL,8,FWater region, the first since the
OL,9,Ffamous drought of 1976, this isn't a
OL,10,Fdecision we've made lightly and we're
OL,11,Fsorry for the inconvenience it will
OL,12,Fcause.
OL,14,F"We know so many of our customers have
OL,15,Falready been taking steps to save
OL,16,Fwater and we're incredibly grateful
OL,17,Ffor their support so far this summer.
OL,18,FIt makes such a difference.
OL,26,@nD@UOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786960091
OL,3,CWessex Water announces hosepipe ban
OL,4,Cacross our region
OL,6,F"But the prolonged and extreme dry
OL,7,Fweather has meant demand across our
OL,8,Fregion has consistently remained at
OL,9,Fmore than 400 million litres per day,
OL,10,F30 per cent above average for this
OL,11,Ftime of year and the equivalent of
OL,12,Falmost half a million hosepipes
OL,13,Frunning for a full hour every day.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786960091
OL,3,CWessex Water announces hosepipe ban
OL,4,Cacross our region
OL,6,F"While we're not running out of water
OL,7,Ffor essential use, our challenge has
OL,8,Fbeen moving water through the network
OL,9,Fquickly enough to meet these record
OL,10,Flevels of demand. This also has an
OL,11,Fimpact on our underground storage
OL,12,Freservoirs, which normally replenish
OL,13,Fwith treated water quickly."
OL,15,FWessex Water is contacting larger
OL,16,Fbusiness customers who are high water
OL,17,Fusers to encourage them to avoid non-
OL,18,Fessential use.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@\O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
