PN,40107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786960091
OL,3,CWessex Water announces hosepipe ban
OL,4,Cacross our region
OL,6,FIt is also continuing to encourage
OL,7,Fhouseholds to make small and simple
OL,8,Fchanges during the ongoing dry spell
OL,9,Fto ensure water supplies and the
OL,10,Fenvironment are protected.
OL,12,FThese include:
OL,14,FSome customers may be exempt from the
OL,15,Fban if they are unable to make
OL,16,Freasonable adjustments due to a health
OL,17,Fcondition or disability.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
