PN,40108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1786960091
OL,3,CWessex Water announces hosepipe ban
OL,4,Cacross our region
OL,6,FUsing a hosepipe for health and safety
OL,7,Fneeds, animal welfare and some
OL,8,Fbusiness services and activities are
OL,9,Falso excluded from the restrictions.
OL,11,FA full list of exemptions can be found
OL,12,Fon their website.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/8
